We are going to include following updates in one or two weeks:

1、2 new pieces of background music;
2、New level system of Decoration Facilities. Players can pay to level up a decoration facility so that it'll have bigger influence to your suicide company;
3、Maybe a little game balance update;
4、Add many new sound effects;
5、Add screen resolution config option to allow players change the window size if they do not like playing with full screen;
6、Shorten playtime needed to clear the game;


We are also discussing about adding a new system which has more fierce competition with computers. The new system will require players to do very fast decisions to play against their opponent. And after we implemented this system, we are going to bring Jump To Die to the LAN world.

